+// stays sharp) and the azimuthal mean of each elevation row (rgb) with the
+// row's mean of the original dome's sun-glow weight max(cos, 0)^6 (alpha).
+// u = sqrt(azimuth from the sun / pi), v = 0.5 + 0.5 sign(l) sqrt(|l| / (pi / 2)).
